#: main.ts:133
msgid "GPU rendering stopped during this run: restart the player to use shader upscaling."
msgstr "GPU 渲染在本次运行中已停止：请重启播放器以使用着色器超分辨率。"

#: main.ts:134
msgid "GPU rendering is on from the next start: restart the player to use shader upscaling."
msgstr "GPU 渲染将在下次启动时开启：请重启播放器以使用着色器超分辨率。"

