#: main.ts:371
msgid "Network"
msgstr "模型规模"

#: main.ts:373
msgid "x2 16 (demanding): the most detail, fast GPU"
msgstr "x2 16（高负载）：细节最多，需要较快的 GPU"

#: main.ts:373
msgid "x2 8: lighter, about half the work"
msgstr "x2 8：较轻，计算量约为一半"

#: main.ts:378
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "模式"

#. {} is the mode (A+A, B+B or C+A).
#: main.ts:383
msgid "Mode {} (demanding)"
msgstr "模式 {}（高负载）"

#. {} is the mode (A, B or C).
#: main.ts:388
msgid "Mode {}"
msgstr "模式 {}"

#: main.ts:393
msgid "Quality"
msgstr "画质"

#: main.ts:396
msgid "Ultra (demanding): largest networks, fastest GPUs"
msgstr "超高画质（高负载）：最大网络，需要最快的 GPU"

#: main.ts:398
msgid "HQ (demanding): large networks, fast GPU"
msgstr "高画质（高负载）：大网络，需要较快的 GPU"

#: main.ts:399
msgid "Fast: smaller networks, most GPUs"
msgstr "快速：小网络，适合大多数 GPU"

#: main.ts:412
msgid "AMD FSR 1: for live action, games and anything that is not anime. Edge-aware upscaling of the brightness detail with light sharpening, up to twice the width and height; light on the GPU."
msgstr "AMD FSR 1：适合真人影像、游戏以及动画以外的内容。按边缘方向放大亮度细节并轻度锐化，宽高最多放大一倍；GPU 负担小。"

#: main.ts:421
msgid "RAVU-lite-AR r3: for live action. Enlarges the brightness detail twice the width and height with a filter learned from video, with anti-ringing for sharp edges; light on the GPU. Runs when the video is enlarged more than about 1.4×."
msgstr "RAVU-lite-AR r3：适合真人影像。用从视频中学习得到的滤波器把亮度细节的宽高放大一倍，并抑制锐利边缘的振铃；GPU 负担小。视频放大超过约 1.4 倍时才运行。"

#: main.ts:430
msgid "FSRCNNX: for live action. A small neural network that enlarges the brightness detail twice the width and height and recovers fine detail; more work than RAVU or FSR. Runs when the video is enlarged more than 1.3×."
msgstr "FSRCNNX：适合真人影像。一个小型神经网络，把亮度细节的宽高放大一倍并恢复细微细节；计算量大于 RAVU 和 FSR。视频放大超过 1.3 倍时才运行。"

#: main.ts:433
msgid "x2 16 (demanding) runs the larger network: the most detail; for fast GPUs."
msgstr "x2 16（高负载）运行较大的网络：细节最多，适合较快的 GPU。"

#: main.ts:434
msgid "x2 8 runs the smaller network: about half the work of x2 16, for most GPUs."
msgstr "x2 8 运行较小的网络：计算量约为 x2 16 的一半，适合大多数 GPU。"

#: main.ts:440
msgid "Mode A: for most 1080p anime and blurry older or SD anime. Restores lines and removes blur, noise and compression smear; can strengthen ringing or banding already in the video."
msgstr "模式 A：适合大多数 1080p 动画，以及模糊的老动画或标清动画。修复线条，去除模糊、噪点和压缩涂抹；视频中已有的振铃或色带可能被加强。"

#: main.ts:443
msgid "Mode B: for most 720p anime and anime downscaled from 1080p. A softer restore that also reduces ringing and aliasing; some blur may stay."
msgstr "模式 B：适合大多数 720p 动画和由 1080p 缩小的动画。修复较柔和，同时减少振铃和锯齿；可能残留一些模糊。"

#: main.ts:446
msgid "Mode C: for clean sources with little blur, such as anime downscaled to 480p. Upscales with denoising and stays closest to the source."
msgstr "模式 C：适合模糊很少的干净片源，例如缩小到 480p 的动画。放大时降噪，最接近原片。"

#: main.ts:449
msgid "Mode A+A (demanding): mode A with a second restore pass: the sharpest lines, but it can ring, band or alias. Only when the video is enlarged 2× or more."
msgstr "模式 A+A（高负载）：模式 A 再加一遍修复：线条最锐利，但可能出现振铃、色带或锯齿。仅在视频放大 2 倍或以上时使用。"

#: main.ts:451
msgid "Mode B+B (demanding): mode B with a second soft restore pass. Only when the video is enlarged 2× or more."
msgstr "模式 B+B（高负载）：模式 B 再加一遍柔和修复。仅在视频放大 2 倍或以上时使用。"

#: main.ts:452
msgid "Mode C+A (demanding): mode C with a restore pass after it. Only when the video is enlarged 2× or more."
msgstr "模式 C+A（高负载）：模式 C 之后再加一遍修复。仅在视频放大 2 倍或以上时使用。"

#: main.ts:456
msgid "Ultra (demanding) runs the largest networks (UL and M): about twice the work of HQ; for the fastest GPUs."
msgstr "超高画质（高负载）运行最大网络（UL 和 M）：计算量约为高画质的两倍，适合最快的 GPU。"

#: main.ts:458
msgid "HQ (demanding) runs the large networks (VL and M): about four times the work of Fast; for fast GPUs."
msgstr "高画质（高负载）运行大网络（VL 和 M）：计算量约为快速的四倍，适合较快的 GPU。"

#: main.ts:459
msgid "Fast runs the smaller networks (M and S), for most GPUs."
msgstr "快速运行较小的网络（M 和 S），适合大多数 GPU。"

#: main.ts:463
msgid "Anime4K: neural networks for anime and cartoons that restore and double the picture twice. Its restore steps can also remove fine detail and texture."
msgstr "Anime4K：面向动画和卡通的神经网络，修复画面并两次放大一倍。其修复步骤也可能抹掉细小的细节和纹理。"

#: main.ts:540
msgid "Shader Upscaling…"
msgstr "着色器超分辨率…"

#: manifest.json
msgid "Shader Upscale for Vestra Player"
msgstr "Vestra Player 着色器超分辨率"

#: manifest.json
msgid "Real-time GPU upscaling with mpv GLSL shaders: Anime4K for anime; AMD FSR 1, RAVU and FSRCNNX for live action"
msgstr "用 mpv GLSL 着色器在 GPU 上实时超分辨率：动画用 Anime4K；真人影像用 AMD FSR 1、RAVU 和 FSRCNNX"

#: manifest.json
msgid "Sharpens and enlarges the video on the GPU while it plays, with mpv shaders bundled in the plugin: Anime4K for anime (six modes, Fast, HQ or Ultra), AMD FSR 1 for everything else, and RAVU (light) or FSRCNNX (high) for live action, plus three add-ons: chroma upscaling (CfL), SSIM downscaling for videos larger than the window, and adaptive sharpening. Video ▸ Shader Upscaling… opens a window to choose them, turn upscaling on and off, and see what is applied. Needs GPU rendering: macOS, or Windows with Video ▸ GPU Rendering (Experimental). Remembers your choice."
msgstr "播放时在 GPU 上锐化并放大视频，使用插件自带的 mpv 着色器：动画用 Anime4K（六种模式，快速、高画质或超高画质），其他内容用 AMD FSR 1，真人影像还可用 RAVU（轻量）或 FSRCNNX（高画质），另有三个附加项：色度放大（CfL）、视频大于窗口时的 SSIM 缩小，以及自适应锐化。“视频 ▸ 着色器超分辨率…”打开一个窗口，可进行选择、开关超分辨率，并查看当前应用的内容。需要 GPU 渲染：macOS，或在 Windows 上打开“视频 ▸ GPU 渲染（实验性）”。会记住你的选择。"

